{"season":3,"episode":1,"episode_title":"Shore Leave","scene":1,"character":"Teddy","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"Okonkwo is really gone?"}
{"season":3,"episode":1,"episode_title":"Shore Leave","scene":1,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Teddy","text":"He is on a rig in the Gulf making twice what I could pay him."}
{"season":3,"episode":1,"episode_title":"Shore Leave","scene":1,"character":"Teddy","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"That is not what I asked."}
{"season":3,"episode":1,"episode_title":"Shore Leave","scene":2,"character":"Marisol","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"You need a second diver and you need one who will tell you no."}
{"season":3,"episode":1,"episode_title":"Shore Leave","scene":2,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Marisol","text":"I have you."}
{"season":3,"episode":1,"episode_title":"Shore Leave","scene":2,"character":"Marisol","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"You have me until you do not."}
{"season":3,"episode":1,"episode_title":"Shore Leave","scene":3,"character":"Rhea","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"I am putting a clause in this one. Miss a milestone and the boat is collateral."}
{"season":3,"episode":1,"episode_title":"Shore Leave","scene":3,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Rhea","text":"Put it in."}
{"season":3,"episode":1,"episode_title":"Shore Leave","scene":3,"character":"Rhea","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"You are not even going to read it, are you."}
{"season":3,"episode":1,"episode_title":"Shore Leave","scene":4,"character":"Teddy","speaks_to":"Marisol","text":"He promised me the second seat on the next contract. In front of the harbour master."}
{"season":3,"episode":1,"episode_title":"Shore Leave","scene":4,"character":"Marisol","speaks_to":"Teddy","text":"Write down the date."}
{"season":3,"episode":1,"episode_title":"Shore Leave","scene":5,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Bosun","text":"I need a diver for Tuesday. Somebody cold-rated."}
{"season":3,"episode":1,"episode_title":"Shore Leave","scene":5,"character":"Bosun","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"What about the boy? You gave him the seat."}
{"season":3,"episode":1,"episode_title":"Shore Leave","scene":5,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Bosun","text":"The boy is not cold-rated. Find me somebody."}
{"season":3,"episode":1,"episode_title":"Shore Leave","scene":6,"character":"Teddy","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"You hired out. You told me the seat was mine."}
{"season":3,"episode":1,"episode_title":"Shore Leave","scene":6,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Teddy","text":"I told you the seat was yours when you were ready for it."}
{"season":3,"episode":1,"episode_title":"Shore Leave","scene":6,"character":"Teddy","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"That is not what you said and everyone on that dock heard you."}
{"season":3,"episode":2,"episode_title":"The Collateral Clause","scene":1,"character":"Rhea","speaks_to":"Marisol","text":"He has missed two milestones. One more and I take the boat."}
{"season":3,"episode":2,"episode_title":"The Collateral Clause","scene":1,"character":"Marisol","speaks_to":"Rhea","text":"Would you actually do it?"}
{"season":3,"episode":2,"episode_title":"The Collateral Clause","scene":1,"character":"Rhea","speaks_to":"Marisol","text":"I have never said a thing I would not do. It is why nobody likes talking to me."}
{"season":3,"episode":2,"episode_title":"The Collateral Clause","scene":2,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Rhea","text":"Give me until the end of the month and you get all three milestones at once."}
{"season":3,"episode":2,"episode_title":"The Collateral Clause","scene":2,"character":"Rhea","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"The end of the month."}
{"season":3,"episode":2,"episode_title":"The Collateral Clause","scene":2,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Rhea","text":"You have my word."}
{"season":3,"episode":2,"episode_title":"The Collateral Clause","scene":3,"character":"Marisol","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"Do you hear yourself? You hand that phrase out like it is small change."}
{"season":3,"episode":2,"episode_title":"The Collateral Clause","scene":4,"character":"Teddy","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"I am taking the Gulf job. Okonkwo put my name in."}
{"season":3,"episode":2,"episode_title":"The Collateral Clause","scene":4,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Teddy","text":"Stay through the month and I will give you a full share. Not a crew cut. A share."}
{"season":3,"episode":2,"episode_title":"The Collateral Clause","scene":4,"character":"Teddy","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"A full share."}
{"season":3,"episode":2,"episode_title":"The Collateral Clause","scene":4,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Teddy","text":"A full share. On my mother's name."}
{"season":3,"episode":2,"episode_title":"The Collateral Clause","scene":5,"character":"Bosun","speaks_to":"Marisol","text":"Month is up. He cleared two milestones and the third is nowhere."}
{"season":3,"episode":2,"episode_title":"The Collateral Clause","scene":6,"character":"Teddy","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"The envelope is a crew cut. You said a full share."}
{"season":3,"episode":2,"episode_title":"The Collateral Clause","scene":6,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Teddy","text":"The month did not go the way I planned it."}
{"season":3,"episode":2,"episode_title":"The Collateral Clause","scene":6,"character":"Teddy","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"It never does. That is the only consistent thing about you."}
{"season":3,"episode":2,"episode_title":"The Collateral Clause","scene":7,"character":"Rhea","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"I am taking the boat on Friday. I told you I would."}
